# Android Development Playbook

When implementing Android work:

- Keep UI, domain, and data boundaries clear.
- Reuse common components and use cases.
- Comment business state, async behavior, and shared modules.
- If UI design is involved, also follow the repository's admin UI quality rules.

## Cross-Project Standards

新项目启动、设计系统制定或跨页面规范统一时，先读取 `project-standards-playbook/SKILL.md` 及其适用细则；小修复按影响范围应用，保留已有确认参数。
